WEBVTT

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.774
It's really, really cool.

00:06:01.816 --> 00:06:03.401
But these concepts,

00:06:03.442 --> 00:06:06.237
none of them are without
their technology challenges.

00:06:07.196 --> 00:06:10.449
But y’all, these are not moonshots.

00:06:10.908 --> 00:06:12.868
They are not moonshots.

00:06:13.327 --> 00:06:16.997
We are talking about making
very incremental changes

00:06:17.039 --> 00:06:21.419
to existing technologies,
methods and techniques

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:26.549
with an eye on more hotter
and deeper geothermal development.

00:06:27.007 --> 00:06:29.593
And these also aren't just ideas.